        "claim": "The ultimate decision on consequences for a breach traditionally remains with the Prime Minister.",
        "evidence_id": "E8",
        "quote": "while they can advise on sanctions, the ultimate decision on consequences for a breach traditionally remains with the Prime Minister"
      },
      {
